{"id": null, "n": "0338001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0338001", "type": "orig", "text": "「不死味」底本為 amatadasamhi 依註釋讀為 amatarasamhi。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0340001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0340001", "type": "orig", "text": "此中帝釋所說一偈，底本不載，今依註釋補入。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0368001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0368001", "type": "orig", "text": "底本之（kakambukāyura）依註釋應讀為 ka Kambukayura。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0362a0301", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0362a0301", "type": "add", "text": "菴【CB】，【南傳】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0379a0701", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0379a0701", "type": "add", "text": "祛【CB】，袪【南傳】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0401a1201", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0401a1201", "type": "add", "text": "捨【CB】，拾【南傳】"}
